menu "Detector USB dashboard"

    config FY_USB_DASHBOARD
        bool "Serve the status page over USB networking, with a USB console"
        depends on TINYUSB_NET_MODE_NCM && TINYUSB_CDC_ENABLED
        default y
        help
            Turns the native USB port into a composite device: a CDC-ACM
            serial port that becomes the console, and a CDC-NCM network
            interface at 192.168.7.1 serving the status page. Only offered
            when the TinyUSB NCM and CDC options are enabled, which the XIAO's
            sdkconfig defaults do.

endmenu
